(d) request erasure of personal data where processing is unlawful;
(e) object to processing of their personal data.'), 0.824001312)

(Document(metadata={'agency': 'NDPC', 'document_name': 'Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023', 'section_number': 'Section 2.', 'section_title': 'Objectives of the Act', 'publication_date': '2023-06-14', 'source_url': 'https://ndpc.gov.ng/download/nigeria-data-protection-act-2023', 'doc_id': 'NDPC-NDPA-2023-2023', 'score': 0.762679935}, page_content='Section 2. Objectives of the Act
The objectives of this Act are to:
(a) regulate the processing of personal data of data subjects in Nigeria;
(b) ensure that the right to privacy of natural persons is protected;
(c) foster safe conduct for transactions involving the exchange of personal data;
(d) prevent manipulation of personal data.'), 0.762679935)

